# Docs source Markdown is compiled to Angular templates by scripts/build-docs.mjs.
# Prettier's Markdown printer rewrites it in two ways the compiler cannot survive:
# it re-wraps long lines, so a raw HTML tag spanning a line break continues on a
# line starting with `>` and is read as a blockquote; and it escapes literal
# punctuation (`An * indicates` becomes `An \* indicates`), which reaches the page
# verbatim. Formatting here is content.
